 ## TOP 3 PROBLEMS
-1. **License contradiction** — hero badge + `<meta>` say "MIT-0"; footer says "Apache 2.0 License." A stranger who cares about license (the main reason to evaluate an open-source tool) gets a self-contradicting page.
